{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣歌手庾澄慶（哈林）出道40年，近來展開《整晚哈音樂》全新巡迴演唱會，再掀樂壇回憶殺。</p><p>身為全能音樂人，他創作過許多膾炙人口的金曲，也會向其他優秀的音樂人邀歌。</p><p>然而，令人意外的是，當年搭配偶像劇《流星花園》風靡全亞洲的神曲《情非得已》，竟差</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T20:24:44.137724+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T20:01:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T20:17:40.017277+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T20:17:40.017277+00:00","content_hash":"1d08fb9ae0302972731feff5bf1928e476553f71df3b83ae6936c28850384afc","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}